    <bpmn:process id="W_W4725" name="W4725. Concentration, Single-Source &amp; Geographic Risk Exposure Analysis" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual analysis; new significant third party; geopolitical event
Frequency: Annual + on event
Volume: 1 concentration view across all third-party types and geographies
Owner: TPRM Program Manager / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Participants: Supply Planning (VS-02), Procurement (VS-03), Treasury (VS-18), Cyber (VS-27.3), Sourcing (VS-122)
Source: workflow W4725 — Concentration, Single-Source &amp; Geographic Risk Exposure Analysis</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4725_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4725_Lane1" name="TPRM Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4725_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4725_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4725_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4725_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4725_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4725_Start3" name="Annual analysis; new significant third party; geopolitical event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4725_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4725_Task4" name="Analyze concentration across all third-party types: sole/single-source vendors…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Analyze concentration across all third-party types: sole/single-source vendors (cement, steel, cable), single 3PL/payment/SaaS/cloud providers, geographic concentration (single port/region/country of origin — VS-02.2/VS-110), and fourth-party concentration (W4724)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Supply / Procurement / Cyber
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Annual + on event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4725_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4725_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4725_Task5" name="Quantify concentration exposure (revenue/COGS/operations at risk from a single…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quantify concentration exposure (revenue/COGS/operations at risk from a single point of failure); set concentration limits per risk-appetite (W4722); extend the supply-side concentration view in VS-21.2 W1328 to all third-party types
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4725_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4725_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4725_Task6" name="Drive mitigation for excessive concentration (dual-source/multi-vendor W4737…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Drive mitigation for excessive concentration (dual-source/multi-vendor W4737, alternate qualification, geographic diversification); monitor concentration as a KRI (W4743) and report to the board (W4728)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Supply / Procurement
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4725_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4725_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4725_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4725_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-167 (ensure third-party risk tiering &amp; oversight.) | - CTL-713: concentration analyzed annually + on event; limits per appetite; breaches mitigated (W4737); extends W1328
Owner: TPRM Program Manager / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
