    <bpmn:process id="W_W4727" name="W4727. Third-Party Financial, Solvency &amp; ESG/Human-Rights Risk Screening" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New third party; annual screening; material event
Frequency: Per third party + annual
Volume: ~80–120 Critical/High third parties (financial); ~30–50 high-exposure ESG (VS-131)
Owner: TPRM Program Manager (joint with Treasury VS-18/VS-105 and ESG VS-25/VS-131)
Participants: Treasury (VS-18), SCF (VS-105), ESG (VS-25), Human-Rights DD (VS-131), Procurement (VS-03)
Source: workflow W4727 — Third-Party Financial, Solvency &amp; ESG/Human-Rights Risk Screening</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4727_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4727_Lane1" name="TPRM Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4727_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4727_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4727_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4727_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4727_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4727_Start3" name="New third party; annual screening; material event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4727_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4727_Task4" name="Screen third-party financial/solvency risk (credit, financials, going-concern…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Screen third-party financial/solvency risk (credit, financials, going-concern indicators) for Critical/High third parties — especially sole-source and large-spend vendors; coordinate with Treasury (VS-18) and SCF (VS-105)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Treasury / Procurement
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / CFO
Duration: Per third party + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4727_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4727_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4727_Task5" name="Screen ESG/human-rights risk (sanctions, modern-slavery, environmental…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Screen ESG/human-rights risk (sanctions, modern-slavery, environmental, governance) per VS-131 and VS-25; especially for high-exposure geographies/categories (imports VS-122, private-label VS-41)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / ESG / Human-Rights DD
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Per third party</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4727_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4727_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4727_Task6" name="Feed financial/ESG findings into the tiering (W4723) and the domain slices…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Feed financial/ESG findings into the tiering (W4723) and the domain slices (VS-105 financial, VS-131 human-rights); manage unacceptable financial/ESG exposure (W4739/W4740)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Treasury / ESG
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4727_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4727_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4727_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4727_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-167 (ensure third-party risk tiering &amp; oversight.) | - CTL-713: Critical/High third parties financially screened annually; ESG/human-rights screened; findings feed tiering
Owner: TPRM Program Manager (joint with Treasury VS-18/VS-105 and ESG VS-25/VS-131)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
